cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or harness, please cite it."
title: "MCP conformance census: harness, dataset and analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An execution-based conformance census of the Model Context Protocol server
  ecosystem. Every self-contained, locally installable stdio server in the
  official registry snapshot was executed in an isolated container and driven
  through a conformance harness covering the initialization lifecycle, tool
  listing, declared-schema validity, and behaviour under an unknown tool name, a
  wrong-typed argument and a malformed JSON-RPC frame. The release carries the
  census rows, the raw protocol transcripts, the registry snapshot and the
  analysis scripts.
